      "Status": "Registered",
      "SummaryOfActivities": "Our volunteers created and gifted baby burial garments to bereaved families who suffered from a miscarriage, stillbirth or neo-natal death of their baby. These were made from donated wedding dresses and donated to hospitals, funeral homes and directly to families at no charge. We also made and gifted tutu skirts and gifts to sick children in hospital or through support groups to brighten their day.",
